      `my relationship to the person who died` IS A `Relationship` @desc Your relationship to the person who died, when they died. One of: "the domestic partner"; "an intimate partner who was not a domestic partner"; "a parent, guardian or step-parent" (not a guardian only because of a statutory office); "a child or stepchild, or a child of whom the person who died was the guardian"; "a brother, sister, stepbrother, stepsister, half-brother or half-sister" (including someone regarded as one under the traditions and customs of the Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander community of the person who died); "another relationship, or none"
